    <briefdescription>
<para>Class implementing a condition node for dual band exit criteria. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class checks conditions to determine when to exit the dual band planning mode. It monitors robot&apos;s progress and agent states to make this decision. It inherits from BT::ConditionNode to integrate with the behavior tree framework. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
